Cell["\<\
Figure 7. How often a program that fits its training terms also passes the \
held-out test. Solved constants hold; enumerated fits to eight terms often do \
not.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ea3225df-4635-4f19-ae11-437a32e6f283"],

