Cell["\<\
Figure 8. Sequences added after round 1, which finds 18,467, 53,117 and \
32,374. Even rounds reuse subprograms found earlier as building blocks; odd \
rounds search deeper.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b9bf61e4-c18a-42de-b162-a1e04b815041"],

