Cell["\<\
Figure 10. How many of the next twelve terms each eight-term fit reproduces. \
19,919 programs reproduce all twelve.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"1a326091-7989-4ec5-bb94-4d09613e0ed4"],

