Cell["\<\
Figure 12. Share of each OEIS keyword's sequences that pass. Digit-based \
sequences (base), tables (tabl) and constants (cons) stay out of reach.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"29644ffe-d7c5-4146-9538-51e0fe0f27d2"],

