Cell["\<\
Figure 14. Program found for A000040 from eight terms: the n-th m + 1 such \
that m + 1 divides m! + 1, which is Wilson's theorem.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"55478977-7d28-44b2-bc5a-123f8d1e9f06"],

