Cell["\<\
Figure 48. Numbers below 700 that the test inside the twenty-term program \
accepts: every prime and three composites, 341, 561 and 645. The search found \
Fermat's test in base 2.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"beba7069-d1f4-4b8d-8210-633a9df268ac"],

