Cell["\<\
Figure 49. The twenty-term program gives the first 68 primes, ten more than \
the OEIS entry records, and then returns 341 = 11 \[Times] 31. Agreement on \
every recorded term is evidence, not proof.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"ccc383de-16d0-4e13-9e58-3823b3eedb9f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"Table", "[", 
