Cell["\<\
The prime gaps subtract two copies of a third program, which tests by trial \
division. It is exact too.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"a5c11c70-6a90-4a6a-8d68-bdb98c41f311"]
}, Open  ]],

